&lt;p style="margin-left: 65px; line-height: 15px; margin-right: 2px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;2022年３月　株式会社ソディック社外取締役（現任）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 65px; line-height: 15px; margin-right: 2px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;2022年６月　一般社団法人日本生活支援工学会代表理事（現任）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:CareerSummaryInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E25664-000GotoYoshikazuMember">(注)４</jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E25664-000TakahashiKazuoMember">

取締役


（監査等委員）

</jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E25664-000TakahashiKazuoMember">髙橋　一夫</jpcrp_cor:NameInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:DateOfBirthInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E25664-000TakahashiKazuoMember">1960-01-08</jpcrp_cor:DateOfBirthInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
  <jpcrp_cor:CareerSummaryInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E25664-000TakahashiKazuoMember">
